From 9a4e9994e6b766ae943598b18067be50f74ae4c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ga=C3=ABl=20Duval?= <gael@murena.io>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 23:51:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(documenteditor): Lock anchor in the Layout dialog,
 like Word

Add Word's "Lock anchor" check box to the Position tab of the picture,
shape and chart Layout dialog, next to "Move object with text" and
"Allow overlap": a locked anchor stays on its paragraph when the object
is dragged elsewhere. Strings in en, fr, de, es, it, pt, pt-pt, nl, ru,
pl, ja and zh (Word's terms).

[upstreamable]

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
